							<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
								Continuous age trajectory mapping across subjects aged 9 to 86 years. The green shaded region depicts the clinical reference interval for healthy young adults (5–6 m/s, Millasseau et al. 2002).
